      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A variety of disorders can cause pain about the hip. The significance of these various disorders varies. Obviously, appropriate treatment cannot be initiated until a correct diagnosis is made. The classic methods of physical diagnosis must be used. X-ray studies or bone scans are most often only confirmatory but frequently necessary."},
